    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exclūsor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		excludo, I. B., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>one who shuts</i> or <i>drives
			out</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">daemoniorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Serm. 37, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. de Verb. Dom.
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp., <i>a maker of silver vessels</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui de confusione massae noverunt formam vasis
					exprimere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. in Psa. 67, § 39</span></i>
			; id. Spir. et Litt. § 17.</div>
